#   mc "I did. I lost..."
    mc "Lo hice. Perdí..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2192
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_43dc876a:

#   l "He snuck on us, ok?! With a knife. Mumbling to himself."
    l "Se nos ha colado, ¿vale?! Con un cuchillo. Murmurando para sí mismo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2194
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_70643cd2:

#   n "Is that so?"
    n "¿Es así?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2195
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_d8dbfb01:

#   l "What if the drunkard killed one of the targets, huh?!"
    l "¿Y si el borracho mató a uno de los objetivos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2197
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_f2c6a295:

#   n "Don't give me that bullshit."
    n "No me vengas con tonterías."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2198
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_be2a9915:

#   n "Who was standing guard?"
    n "¿Quién montaba guardia?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2200
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_3e788d02:

#   l "I was."
    l "Lo estaba."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2201
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_e8f7ccfb:

#   n "Did you not see him getting closer?"
    n "¿No le viste acercarse?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2203
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_a9717f32:

#   l "Sorry for not expecting a knifer at the underground parking lot!"
    l "¡Perdón por no esperar a un knifer en el aparcamiento subterráneo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2204
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_76166ff5:

#   n "If you were standing guard, then why did you let [mc] beat him up?"
    n "Si estabas de guardia, ¿por qué dejaste que [mc] le diera una paliza?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2206
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_29a1b8f0:

#   l "Ok, that's enough questions! The guy is alive, and nobody got caught."
    l "Vale, ¡basta de preguntas! El tipo está vivo y no han cogido a nadie."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2208
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_57da577a:

#   mc "Guys, don't fight. It was me. I fucked up, I know! I lost my temper and I swear it will never happen again."
    mc "Chicos, no os peleéis. He sido yo. La he cagado, ¡lo sé! He perdido los nervios y juro que no volverá a ocurrir."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2209
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c35ffd7a:

#   n "Fair enough. At least you took responsibility. I respect that."
    n "Me parece justo, al menos has asumido tu responsabilidad, lo respeto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2211
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_e1b2b345:

#   n "But don't do it again! Unless absolutely necessary."
    n "Pero no vuelvas a hacerlo, a menos que sea absolutamente necesario."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2224
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_65129c6c:

#   l "I did. Why?"
    l "¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2225
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ee9480b0:

#   mc "Yeah. He came out of nowhere. Armed! Talking to himself."
    mc "Sí. Salió de la nada. ¡Armado! Hablando solo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2227
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_4a692be9:

#   l "So we labeled him as unpredictable and dangerous."
    l "Así que lo etiquetamos como impredecible y peligroso."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2228
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_cd873d49:

#   l "Since we're doing everything by the book, I'm looking at you [n], according to protocol, we were supposed to take him out."
    l "Ya que lo hacemos todo según las normas, te miro a ti [n], según el protocolo, debíamos eliminarlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2229
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_f281f760:

#   l "And I did. Simple!"
    l "Y lo hice. ¡Sencillo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2231
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_4964ba07:

#   n "Who was the watch?"
    n "¿Quién era el reloj?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2237
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_13023756:

#   n "Cut the crap. You'd recognize a knifer faster than I would a liar."
    n "Déjate de tonterías. Reconocerías a un knifer más rápido que yo a un mentiroso."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2238
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_0930c3f2:

#   l "Ok, that's enough questions! The guy is alive, and nobody has seen us. End of story."
    l "Vale, ¡ya basta de preguntas! El tipo está vivo y nadie nos ha visto. Fin de la historia."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2240
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_068cb895:

#   n "[mc], you? Why didn't you stop him?"
    n "[mc], ¿tú? ¿Por qué no le detuviste?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2244
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_4a485c82:

#   mc "He had it coming."
    mc "Se lo merecía."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2246
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_f971804e:

#   n "At least you're telling the truth."
    n "Al menos dices la verdad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2247
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_4d2f34a4:

#   n "Whether you're right or not is an entirely different matter."
    n "Que tengas razón o no es una cuestión totalmente distinta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2251
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_23344e39:

#   mc "I don't know. It all happened so fast."
    mc "No lo sé, todo ocurrió muy rápido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2253
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_365f01dd:

#   l "The guy was an ass. I taught him a lesson."
    l "El tipo era un imbécil y le di una lección."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2254
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ef08e771:

#   l "As a matter of fact, he should thank me!"
    l "De hecho, ¡debería darme las gracias!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2260
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_37c3a956:

#   mc "I don't know what to tell you."
    mc "No sé qué decirte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2262
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ae653b20:

#   mc "I was so focused on lockpicking that car, which I failed anyway, I didn't think the situation would escalate that quickly."
    mc "Estaba tan concentrado en abrir el coche, cosa que no conseguí de todos modos, que no pensé que la situación se agravaría tan rápidamente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2264
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_d0b0745c:

#   n "So you weren't the one who hit him. Got it."
    n "Así que no fuiste tú quien le pegó. Entendido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2265
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_af5c00c9:

#   mc "I didn't get the chance."
    mc "No tuve la oportunidad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2267
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_b02eada8:

#   l "If he had gotten the chance, he would've taken it. Trust me on this, [n], even with you missing a leg, you would've too."
    l "Si hubiera tenido la oportunidad, la habría aprovechado. Créeme en esto, [n], aunque te faltara una pierna, tú también lo habrías hecho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2269
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c5d16990:

#   n "It was that bad, huh?"
    n "¿Tan malo era?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2270
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_206049a8:

#   n "And I'm not missing a leg."
    n "Y no me falta una pierna."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2272
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_bdc5972a:

#   l "Even worse."
    l "Peor aún."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2275
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_7d83c3ef:

#   n "Both of you are hungry for action. I get it. A time will come when crazy shit happens, and the only right thing to do is embrace it."
    n "Ambos estáis hambrientos de acción. Lo entiendo. Llegará un momento en que ocurran locuras y lo único que hay que hacer es aceptarlas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2276
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_35adec50:

#   n "But not now. Not yet. It's the first fucking day!"
    n "Pero ahora no. Todavía no. ¡Es el puto primer día!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2278
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_e0445893:

#   n "Come on, guys. Don't make it more difficult than it has to be."
    n "Vamos, chicos, no lo hagáis más difícil de lo que tiene que ser."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2279
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c2f5ef7a:

#   l "How about you stop with the lessons, and you start doing something for the team?"
    l "¿Qué tal si te dejas de lecciones y empiezas a hacer algo por el equipo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2282
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_918fea83:

#   mc "I'm sorry."
    mc "Lo siento."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2283
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_54756097:

#   n "I believe you. Try to take things slow next time, ok?"
    n "Te creo. Intenta tomarte las cosas con calma la próxima vez, ¿vale?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2284
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_08b5df7f:

#   mc "Ok."
    mc "De acuerdo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2287
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_8c634f0c:

#   n "Just... No comment."
    n "Simplemente... Sin comentarios."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2288
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_bd20ac0a:

#   l "We're sorry. We'll try to do better next time."
    l "Lo sentimos. Intentaremos hacerlo mejor la próxima vez."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2290
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ebea651f:

#   l "Happy now?"
    l "¿Ya estás contento?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2291
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_7f1c6f96:

#   n "Like I'm gonna believe you."
    n "Como si fuera a creerte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2295
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ffe98ec2:

#   mc "In our defence, I do think we learned something valuable."
    mc "En nuestra defensa, creo que aprendimos algo valioso."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2300
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c22d2738:

#   mc "Regular people, working class to be more specific, hate [z]."
    mc "La gente normal, la clase trabajadora para ser más específicos, odia [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2301
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ca534611:

#   mc "Sounds like they're ready to put [z]'s rich ass straight under the guillotine."
    mc "Parece que están dispuestos a poner el culo rico de [z] directamente bajo la guillotina."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2307
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_da9ae835:

#   l "What if I tell you we learned a thing or two?"
    l "¿Y si te digo que hemos aprendido un par de cosas?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2308
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_6507db9d:

#   n "Like what?"
    n "¿Cómo qué?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2309
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_6092e7f4:

#   l "Regular people hate [z]. I'd say they're a few steps away from starting a revolution."
    l "La gente normal odia [z]. Yo diría que están a un paso de iniciar una revolución."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2312
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_2acda3ab:

#   n "Hmmm. You should've started with the good news instead!"
    n "Hmmm. ¡Deberías haber empezado por las buenas noticias!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2313
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_73fea06d:

#   n "You would have been spared the lesson."
    n "Te habrías ahorrado la lección."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2316
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_e1e2f030:

#   l "Oh. So the next time we kick someone's ass, we'll make up a story to avoid your yelling!"
    l "Oh. ¡Así que la próxima vez que le demos una patada en el culo a alguien, nos inventaremos una historia para evitar tus gritos!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2317
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_0659a262:

#   l "Great idea! Thanks."
    l "¡Gran idea! Gracias."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2322
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_494ccef0:

#   n "How many points did you score?"
    n "¿Cuántos puntos has conseguido?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2323
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_d94db7b8:

#   l "None..."
    l "Ninguno..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2325
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_497b9f98:

#   l "Or one, maybe."
    l "O uno, tal vez."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2326
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_6dfc41b6:

#   mc "Points?"
    mc "¿Puntos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2328
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_1d4c95cc:

#   l "Yeah, the danger level. Every time you act recklessly, the simulation danger level increases."
    l "Sí, el nivel de peligro. Cada vez que actúas de forma imprudente, aumenta el nivel de peligro de la simulación."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2329
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_66f04885:

#   l "Eleven levels."
    l "Once niveles."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2331
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_2cfe4c88:

#   n "Ten levels. If you're stupid enough to reach the last one, we're done."
    n "Diez niveles. Si eres tan estúpido como para llegar al último, hemos terminado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2332
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_7c3218ee:

#   n "Reaching level 10 means we're dead."
    n "Alcanzar el nivel 10 significa que estamos muertos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2334
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_3ad9e25b:

#   mc "That's when the [exe] steps in?"
    mc "¿Es entonces cuando interviene el [exe]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2335
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_51ecb10d:

#   n "Not just steps in. He walks past these doors, and there is no way in hell we'll make it out alive."
    n "No sólo entra. Pasa por estas puertas y no hay forma de que salgamos vivos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2337
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_35e9d54f:

#   n "This was supposed to go right through my skull. Only a miracle saved me."
    n "Esto debía atravesarme el cráneo. Sólo un milagro me salvó."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2338
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ef584c24:

#   n "The sim must have bugged out or something. The [exe] never misses."
    n "La simulación debe haberse estropeado o algo. El [exe] nunca falla."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2340
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_9340b54b:

#   mc "Then we got to level 1. So, what now? A few more actions like this one and we're done?"
    mc "Entonces llegamos al nivel 1. ¿Y ahora qué? ¿Unas cuantas acciones más como ésta y ya está?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2341
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_8029e4e5:

#   n "No. There will be ways to decrease..."
    n "No. Habrá formas de disminuir..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2343
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_37cec71d:

#   l "Or increase!"
    l "¡O aumentar!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2344
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_97bf82e8:

#   n "... the danger level."
    n "... el nivel de peligro."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2346
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_ef9683c2:

#   n "Ugh. Fine. Ways to CONTROL the danger level. Both ways."
    n "Bien. Formas de CONTROLAR el nivel de peligro. De las dos maneras."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2347
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_0deb66f5:

#   n "Through various jobs, hangout activities and so on."
    n "A través de diversos trabajos, actividades de pasar el rato, etc."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2349
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_7c05979f:

#   n "Low danger doesn't mean no action at all."
    n "Poco peligro no significa ninguna acción."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2350
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_b4cf5f5d:

#   n "Also, I've never complained about boredom."
    n "Además, nunca me he quejado de aburrimiento."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2352
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_d3a12079:

#   l "Yeah, right! You do nothing but complain."
    l "Sí, claro, no haces más que quejarte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2353
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_07a399fa:

#   l "HOWEVER, more danger, more fun."
    l "SIN EMBARGO, más peligro, más diversión."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2355
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c04d8f64:

#   l "More pussibilities. If you know what I mean."
    l "Más pussibilidades, si me entiendes."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2357
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_b3f16486:

#   n "Tell me about those 'pussibilities', [l]. Tell us how much of a heart stealer you are... as a virgin."
    n "Háblame de esas \"pussibilidades\", [l]. Cuéntanos hasta qué punto eres una roba corazones... siendo virgen."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2358
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_a1b439cc:

#   l "I am!"
    l "Lo estoy haciendo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2360
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_9142a35a:

#   n "Heart stealer or a virgin?"
    n "¿Robacorazones o virgen?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2361
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_e6348909:

#   l "Fuck you!"
    l "¡Que te jodan!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2363
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_4f22f0fe:

#   l "Living on the edge doesn't mean you have to be a dick! You can still be a good guy!"
    l "¡Vivir al límite no significa que tengas que ser un capullo! ¡Todavía puedes ser un buen tipo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2365
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_6bce92b4:

#   n "We're not good guys. That's one. And two. Don't think you can live on the edge without consequences. You'd be stupid to think that you can."
    n "No somos buenos chicos. Ésa es una. Y dos. No creas que puedes vivir al límite sin consecuencias. Serías estúpido si pensaras que puedes."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2367
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_37f26b33:

#   l "I can! I've been doing this for years!"
    l "¡Puedo! ¡Llevo años haciéndolo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2369
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_d50c028f:

#   n "But you're not a Cock. Cocks have responsibilities towards both party girls... and virgins. You can't have both."
    n "Pero tú no eres un Gallo. Los Gallos tienen responsabilidades tanto con las fiesteras... como con las vírgenes. No puedes tener las dos cosas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2370
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_9e87c987:

#   n "The best way to act is to set yourself right in the middle. Act accordingly. No matter what you go for, each approach requires skill."
    n "La mejor forma de actuar es situarte justo en el medio. Actúa en consecuencia. Independientemente de lo que elijas, cada enfoque requiere habilidad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2373
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_30035a0c:

#   mc "[msd] didn't seem to like this approach."
    mc "[msd] no parecía gustarle este enfoque."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2374
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_44f68ec9:

#   n "[msd] knows shit."
    n "[msd] sabe una mierda."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2376
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_37202a05:

#   l "She's hot. That automatically makes her right."
    l "Está buena, eso la convierte automáticamente en correcta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2379
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c2de90e4:

#   mc "Who is? [n] or [msd]? I'd say both."
    mc "¿Quién es? [n] o [msd]? Yo diría que ambos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2380
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_5f3471fd:

#   l "Good one!"
    l "¡Muy buena!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2381
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c176b122:

#   n "Ugh."
    n "Uf."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2384
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_2ac112e6:

#   mc "So [msd] shouldn't be trusted?"
    mc "¿Así que no se debe confiar en [msd]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2385
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_c704c262:

#   n "Do whatever you want, but long gone are the days of great leadership at Aegis. I suggest thinking on your own."
    n "Haz lo que quieras, pero ya han pasado los días de gran liderazgo en Aegis. Te sugiero que pienses por tu cuenta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2386
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_6adc101a:

#   l "The way you phrased it, I suddenly felt like I'm in a fantasy sim."
    l "Por la forma en que lo has expresado, de repente me he sentido como si estuviera en una simulación de fantasía."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:2387
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_return_568c576e:

