    msd "Bueno, bueno, bueno..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5411
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_msd_185d7d9e:

#   msd "Seems like the promise of becoming an Aegis agent made an impression."
    msd "Parece que la promesa de convertirte en agente de Aegis te impresionó."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5413
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_msd_7008e7cb:

#   msd "Maybe it wasn't the position itself that convinced you?"
    msd "¿Quizá no fue el puesto en sí lo que te convenció?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5415
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_msd_8bda0d9a:

#   msd "Maybe the rewards?"
    msd "¿Quizá las recompensas?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5417
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_msd_4813c731:

#   msd "Such rewards for you, my [mc]."
    msd "Tales recompensas para ti, mi [mc]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5419
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_msd_8b579478:

#   msd "You just have to complete the mission first, and I promise I'll make it worthwhile."
    msd "Sólo tienes que completar la misión primero, y te prometo que haré que merezca la pena."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5436
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_2a656d29:

#   ass "Mmm, [mc]! Always great to see you!"
    ass "Mmm, [mc] ¡Siempre es un placer verte!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5438
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_adcc33d5:

#   ass "Compared to Deloney, I don't have much to show, but I make it up with eagerness."
    ass "Comparado con Deloney, no tengo mucho que mostrar, pero lo compenso con ganas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5439
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_8a9dd8ef:

#   ass "You know, all Aegis agents require a machine to lower their stress level while deployed."
    ass "Todos los agentes Aegis necesitan una máquina para reducir su nivel de estrés mientras están desplegados."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5441
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_86c5a917:

#   ass "You, [mc], don't need a machine to control your urges."
    ass "Tú, [mc], no necesitas una máquina para controlar tus impulsos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5443
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_cdf7a2ca:

#   ass "You have me and I'll do whatever you want me to."
    ass "Me tienes a mí y haré lo que quieras que haga."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5444
translate HZIlle ep1_dream_ass_b9202400:

#   ass "As long as you give your best to complete the mission."
    ass "Siempre que des lo mejor de ti para completar la misión."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5458
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_53a339aa:

#   mc "Ugh!"
    mc "¡Uf!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5459
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_347c8641:

#   mc "[v], should I expect more accidents like this?"
    mc "[v], ¿debo esperar más accidentes como éste?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5461
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_9625ac8c:

#   v "I'm tempted to say it's highly unlikely. We don't usually have this much action at the start."
    v "Estoy tentado de decir que es muy poco probable. No solemos tener tanta acción al principio."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5462
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_1f375316:

#   v "But you and [l]..."
    v "Pero tú y [l]..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5467
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_5660a854:

#   v "Either you look for trouble or trouble finds you. A rare talent for a duo to attract this much attention."
    v "O buscas problemas o los problemas te encuentran a ti. Un raro talento para que un dúo atraiga tanta atención."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5468
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_efede333:

#   mc "Luckily, I fainted after the meeting with [z]. Otherwise, it was game over."
    mc "Por suerte, me desmayé tras el encuentro con [z]. De lo contrario, se acabó el juego."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5470
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_bf1c5cf9:

#   mc "Does the illness kick in only in highly stressful situations?"
    mc "¿La enfermedad sólo aparece en situaciones muy estresantes?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5471
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_54d7ecbc:

#   v "When the stress level reaches too high. You have to learn to manage it."
    v "Cuando el nivel de estrés es demasiado alto, tienes que aprender a gestionarlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5472
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_91905ede:

#   mc "How?"
    mc "¿Cómo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5474
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_b002da7f:

#   v "It depends on your attitude. The Morph drug fixes everything. [l], for instance, prefers natural means in the form of training. He's having too much fun if you ask me."
    v "Depende de tu actitud. La droga Morph lo arregla todo. [l], por ejemplo, prefiere los medios naturales en forma de entrenamiento. En mi opinión, se divierte demasiado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5475
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_2fd8aa57:

#   v "[n]... [n]'s case is far more complicated. She's been in the business for far too long. No organism can suffer through this much."
    v "[n]... El caso de [n] es mucho más complicado. Lleva demasiado tiempo en el negocio. Ningún organismo puede sufrir tanto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5476
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_1c646f96:

#   v "She needs her Morph dosage to survive."
    v "Necesita su dosis de Morph para sobrevivir."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5478
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_09afb406:

#   mc "How about you?"
    mc "¿Y tú?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5479
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_c4b8b5a3:

#   v "Neither."
    v "Tampoco."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5481
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_99892ad5:

#   n "Stress doesn't really affect one THAT much. I'm sure it was because of the data transfer."
    n "El estrés no le afecta a uno TANTO. Seguro que era por la transferencia de datos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5482
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_637b6069:

#   n "The Aegis already noticed your vital functions going down. They will counteract shortly."
    n "La Égida ya se ha dado cuenta de que tus funciones vitales están disminuyendo. Las contrarrestará en breve."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5483
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_e20b8b83:

#   n "Did you sign the data transfer agreement before your deployment?"
    n "¿Firmaste el acuerdo de transferencia de datos antes de tu despliegue?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5485
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_cf1adef2:

#   mc "Yeah."
    mc "Sí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5486
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_b39b49ba:

#   v "You know how it goes, then."
    v "Entonces, ya sabes cómo va esto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5488
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_e1b6c82d:

#   mc "Ummm... Sorry, I must have been distracted."
    mc "Ummm... Lo siento, me habré distraído."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5489
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_dcf9a98f:

#   v "So you don't know."
    v "Así que no lo sabes."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5490
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_159ffd92:

#   v "Well, given your profession, you'll most likely get milked to help you manage the stress."
    v "Bueno, dada tu profesión, lo más probable es que te ordeñen para ayudarte a controlar el estrés."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5492
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_e443bcfa:

#   mc "Really?! And I signed it without even knowing it? They must've written it in the tiniest print possible!"
    mc "¿En serio? ¿Y lo he firmado sin saberlo? ¡Lo habrán escrito con la letra más pequeña posible!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5493
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_8eda76ee:

#   n "Another idiot. Who would've guessed?"
    n "Otro idiota. ¿Quién lo hubiera imaginado?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5494
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_d57f4813:

#   v "If you knew, you wouldn't have signed it?"
    v "Si lo supieras, ¿no lo habrías firmado?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5496
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_d29ed640:

#   mc "Milked by who?"
    mc "¿Ordeñada por quién?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5497
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_caf7e6b9:

#   v "By WHAT you mean. A machine."
    v "A QUÉ te refieres: a una máquina."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5499
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_5a20d21b:

#   n "No sane person would ever touch a sleeping dude's penis. Unless that's part of the plan to wake him up."
    n "Ninguna persona en su sano juicio tocaría jamás el pene de un tipo dormido. A menos que eso forme parte del plan para despertarlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5500
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_993b24e2:

#   n "Otherwise, creepy as fuck."
    n "Por lo demás, espeluznante de cojones."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5502
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_1719081a:

#   mc "Will I feel anything?"
    mc "¿Sentiré algo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5503
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_5c050259:

#   v "No, nothing. Probably a good dream at best."
    v "No, nada. Probablemente un buen sueño como mucho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5508
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_0530c5e2:

#   mc "Girls! I'm in!"
    mc "¡Chicas! ¡Me apunto!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5509
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_d73f8769:

#   mc "I've got a meeting with [z]!"
    mc "¡Tengo una reunión con [z]!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5511
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_aac20095:

#   n "Impressive. Try not to faint."
    n "Impresionante. Intenta no desmayarte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5513
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_282c5236:

#   v "Today?"
    v "¿Hoy?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5514
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_f9bef5b7:

#   v "I'm not sure if that's a good idea. You've been through so much lately."
    v "Últimamente has pasado por muchas cosas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5516
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_44af7022:

#   mc "The whole mission depends on me. My career as an agent. My future."
    mc "Toda la misión depende de mí. Mi carrera como agente. Mi futuro."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5517
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_da9e1edf:

#   mc "Failing isn't an option."
    mc "Fracasar no es una opción."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5520
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_2a5fd7cc:

#   n "Jesus."
    n "Jesús."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5521
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_fd509da6:

#   n "Go get them, hero!"
    n "¡A por ellos, héroe!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5525
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_3f667681:

#   mc "What do you think? Respectable and classy?"
    mc "¿Qué te parece? ¿Respetable y con clase?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5526
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_c08d7db1:

#   v "You look handsome! I'd take you in if I were [z]."
    v "¡Estás guapo! Yo te acogería si fuera [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5528
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_896b006e:

#   n "Don't take it as a compliment, though. [v] would take anyone in."
    n "Pero no te lo tomes como un cumplido. [v] Acogería a cualquiera."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5529
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_86ecc5b1:

#   v "That's not true!"
    v "Eso no es verdad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5531
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_ecb11726:

#   n "Moms never tell their sons they look ugly as hell."
    n "Las madres nunca dicen a sus hijos que son feos de cojones."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5533
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_0a3ca53c:

#   mc "Huh. Good point. My mom always used to tell me I was the most handsome man in the world."
    mc "Buena observación. Mi madre siempre me decía que era el hombre más guapo del mundo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5534
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_4965fa63:

#   mc "'Sister' would, though. So? What do you think, [n]?"
    mc "Sin embargo, \"Hermana\" sí. ¿Y? ¿Qué opinas, [n]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5537
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_5be9a38b:

#   n "You look like a nice person."
    n "Pareces una buena persona."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5538
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_ed705245:

#   mc "Nice? That's it?"
    mc "¿Bonito? ¿Eso es todo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5541
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_a8a7cbff:

#   n "You look good."
    n "Tienes buen aspecto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5545
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_3a5a8f68:

#   mc "I appreciate the compliment!"
    mc "¡Te agradezco el cumplido!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5546
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_7d80266a:

#   n "I always tell the truth!"
    n "¡Siempre digo la verdad!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5550
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_28c2359b:

#   mc "[v] did a much better job. Try harder next time, [n]!"
    mc "[v] hizo un trabajo mucho mejor. ¡Inténtalo mejor la próxima vez, [n]!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5551
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_109ce97d:

#   n "Not a chance, you spoiled brat."
    n "Ni hablar, mocoso malcriado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5552
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_828d5523:

#   v "[mc]'s right. You need to learn to appreciate other people more."
    v "[mc] Tienes razón, tienes que aprender a apreciar más a los demás."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5554
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_f6fa9f29:

#   mc "If you ever need a lesson..."
    mc "Si alguna vez necesitas una lección..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5555
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_04f44c86:

#   n "Shut up! Both of you."
    n "Callaos los dos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5559
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_4cf4380c:

#   mc "If that's the case, I look forward to seeing you get 'stuck' somewhere."
    mc "Si es así, estoy deseando verte \"atrapado\" en algún sitio."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5561
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_2ad877fa:

#   n "I don't even want to know what that means."
    n "No quiero ni saber lo que eso significa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5562
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_66c773db:

#   mc "Sure you don't."
    mc "Claro que no."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5565
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_de2b9e19:

#   mc "Wish me luck!"
    mc "¡Deséame suerte!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5566
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_610dad93:

#   v "Good luck!"
    v "Buena suerte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5567
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_2851e814:

#   n "Yeah, whatever."
    n "Sí, da igual."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5569
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_647ae90c:

#   v "Also, stop the mom bullshit. It's creepy."
    v "Además, déjate de gilipolleces de madre, es espeluznante."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5570
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_54b9d6af:

#   v "I don't like it."
    v "No me gusta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5572
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_eef32ac2:

#   n "Why now? You didn't mind it earlier."
    n "¿Por qué ahora? Antes no te importaba."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5573
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_fbb97a7a:

#   v "I do mind it now."
    v "Ahora sí me importa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5579
translate HZIlle ep1_interrogation_nextday_2c8dd0f2:

#   n "Oh really? I wonder why."
    n "¿De verdad? Me pregunto por qué."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5588
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_63009a0e:

#   pol1 "Attackers captured, interrogated..."
    pol1 "Atacantes capturados, interrogados..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5589
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_67d691a8:

#   z "And the case still unresolved."
    z "Y el caso sigue sin resolverse."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5594
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_42daa22d:

#   pol1 "They have no connection to other crime families."
    pol1 "No tienen ninguna conexión con otras familias del crimen."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5595
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_acecc6ab:

#   pol1 "Hell, one of them isn't even on the record!"
    pol1 "Diablos, ¡uno de ellos ni siquiera está en el disco!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5597
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_1c099ab1:

#   pol1 "Nothing to indicate the reason behind the measures they have taken!"
    pol1 "¡Nada que indique el motivo de las medidas que han tomado!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5599
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_73ff889d:

#   z "Measures. I almost got killed and the police are not taking enough MEASURES to find the truth."
    z "Medidas. Casi me matan y la policía no toma suficientes MEDIDAS para averiguar la verdad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5600
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_ab46f573:

#   z "Let me have them. I'll use my methods to open them up for talking."
    z "Déjamelos a mí. Utilizaré mis métodos para abrirlos a la conversación."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5602
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_e3b5b63f:

#   pol1 "Torture? Doesn't matter how much you pay me, Mr [z]. I can't release a suspect and hand him over to you."
    pol1 "¿Tortura? No importa cuánto me pague, Sr. [z]. No puedo liberar a un sospechoso y entregárselo a usted."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5603
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_f58964fc:

#   pol1 "It's not possible!"
    pol1 "¡No es posible!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5605
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_7a4585ef:

#   z "Which one? The one in jail? Or the one missing?"
    z "¿Cuál? ¿El que está en la cárcel? ¿O el que ha desaparecido?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5607
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_9719d316:

#   pol1 "What?"
    pol1 "¿Cómo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5609
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_c5cbe6f0:

#   z "Where's the second one? The one who didn't shoot?"
    z "¿Dónde está el segundo? ¿El que no disparó?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5611
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_8053de84:

#   pol1 "You are asking too much of me! I..."
    pol1 "¡Me pides demasiado! Yo..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5612
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_74ac1b02:

#   pol1 "Nothing I can do. A few more actions like this and we'll bring the [bur] on our heads!"
    pol1 "No puedo hacer nada. ¡Unas cuantas acciones más como ésta y traeremos el [bur] sobre nuestras cabezas!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5614
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_fe0f915d:

#   pol1 "And then... every man for himself. We can't let that happen."
    pol1 "Y luego... sálvese quien pueda. No podemos permitir que eso ocurra."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5616
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_1c5e3e12:

#   z "So you are happy with being on my payroll. How about you do something to earn that paycheck!"
    z "Así que estás contento con estar en mi nómina. ¿Qué tal si haces algo para ganarte ese sueldo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5617
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_21101104:

#   z "Did you check their phones?"
    z "¿Has comprobado sus teléfonos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5619
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_7c9f9735:

#   pol1 "Yes."
    pol1 "Sí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5620
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_83777ae8:

#   z "Any pictures?"
    z "¿Alguna foto?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5622
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_1231c3ae:

#   pol1 "No."
    pol1 "No."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5623
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_792b0dd0:

#   z "Videos?"
    z "¿Vídeos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5625
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_d6aafe92:

#   pol1 "Also no. What are you trying to say?"
    pol1 "Tampoco. ¿Qué intentas decir?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5626
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_24c6792b:

#   z "If you're lying to me..."
    z "Si me estás mintiendo..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5628
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_5c2221d5:

#   pol1 "I have no reason to lie to you about pictures or videos they may have taken. If any."
    pol1 "No tengo ningún motivo para mentirte sobre las fotos o vídeos que hayan podido hacer, si es que los han hecho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5630
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_8fe0c55f:

#   z "Where did it go, then? I'm convinced one of them took a photo or video of... me."
    z "Estoy convencido de que uno de ellos hizo una foto o un vídeo de... mí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5631
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_78411db2:

#   z "I assumed you went through their phones with proper caution?"
    z "¿Supongo que revisaste sus teléfonos con la debida precaución?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5633
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_c0b519fa:

#   pol1 "Of course!"
    pol1 "Por supuesto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5634
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_e73f12ec:

#   z "Tell me, what exactly did you find?"
    z "Dime, ¿qué has encontrado exactamente?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5635
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_99443815:

#   z "Who sent them? Who do they work for?"
    z "¿Quién los envía? ¿Para quién trabajan?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5637
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_227b3cb3:

#   pol1 "We don't know."
    pol1 "No lo sabemos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5639
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_44bd55b6:

#   z "Consider this a warning. If the attackers were sent by one of the crime families, you're gonna have a gang war on your hands."
    z "Considera esto una advertencia. Si los atacantes fueron enviados por una de las familias del crimen, vas a tener una guerra de bandas entre manos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5640
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_2997cc30:

#   z "Things will turn out even worse if there's a new player in town. I suggest you start cooperating."
    z "Las cosas irán aún peor si hay un nuevo jugador en la ciudad. Te sugiero que empieces a cooperar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5642
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_4a7cb0b1:

#   z "Do I have to remind you of the aftermath of the last gang war?"
    z "¿Tengo que recordarte las consecuencias de la última guerra de bandas?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5644
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_207e65fa:

#   pol1 "We're trying our best!"
    pol1 "¡Nos esforzamos al máximo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5645
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_8e3adc7e:

#   z "Try harder!"
    z "¡Esfuérzate más!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5647
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_7b9d178a:

#   pol1 "Please, Mr [z], don't let pride cloud your judgment! An open war..."
    pol1 "Por favor, Sr. [z], ¡no dejes que el orgullo nuble tu juicio! Una guerra abierta..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5649
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_692e21f8:

#   z "Two randoms off the street, with only one who knew how to handle a gun. Paid and hired by someone with a clearly defined goal."
    z "Dos cualquiera de la calle, y sólo uno de ellos sabía manejar un arma. Pagados y contratados por alguien con un objetivo claramente definido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5650
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_87ea8756:

#   z "To kill me."
    z "Para matarme."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5652
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_5fb4869c:

#   z "How difficult is it to break a regular Jack and Joe to start singing?! Find out who sent them or I'll do that myself."
    z "¿Qué tan difícil es hacer que un Jack y un Joe normales empiecen a cantar? Averigua quién los envió o lo haré yo mismo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5653
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_cc2d8a34:

#   z "No force will stop me from getting to the attacker you put in jail."
    z "Ninguna fuerza me impedirá llegar hasta el agresor que metiste en la cárcel."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5655
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_65a2a486:

#   pol1 "We did find something..."
    pol1 "Encontramos algo..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5656
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_6eb4d17e:

#   pol1 "Mr [z], I believe we are dealing with a new kind of criminal activity."
    pol1 "Señor [z], creo que nos enfrentamos a un nuevo tipo de actividad delictiva."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5658
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_436f7ce2:

#   pol1 "Unorganised, Net-based, and without a proper chain of command. Almost impossible to track down!"
    pol1 "Desorganizados, basados en la Red y sin una cadena de mando adecuada. ¡Casi imposibles de localizar!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5660
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_f950cf67:

#   z "At least some intel to push us forward."
    z "Al menos alguna información que nos haga avanzar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5662
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_e6dd1c9f:

#   z "And almost impossible? How about we increase our chances by joining forces?"
    z "¿Y casi imposible? ¿Qué tal si aumentamos nuestras posibilidades uniendo nuestras fuerzas?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5663
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_police_570bab61:

#   pol1 "I'm listening."
    pol1 "Te escucho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5673
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_68b4bf5f:

#   mct "Strange place for a meeting."
    mct "Extraño lugar para una reunión."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5678
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_847b8266:

#   mct "ZAG. Zhine Automotive Group. A car dealership. Target's legal company."
    mct "ZAG. Zhine Automotive Group. Un concesionario de coches. La empresa legal de Target."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5679
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_823f1d1e:

#   mct "One of many, I assume."
    mct "Uno de tantos, supongo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5684
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_b8c7f399:

#   mct "Me as a car salesman or repairman? Fuck no! Not a chance."
    mct "¿Yo como vendedor o reparador de coches? ¡Joder, no! Ni de coña."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5685
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_85ecaeb2:

#   mct "I'd much rather deal with more action-oriented activities."
    mct "Prefiero ocuparme de actividades más orientadas a la acción."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5687
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_4a7a3cbe:

#   mct "And [z] is late. Showing me who's the boss already."
    mct "Y [z] llega tarde. Ya me está demostrando quién es el jefe."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5692
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_edec7298:

#   "???" "Are you looking for someone?"
    "???" "¿Buscas a alguien?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5693
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_b4dd367d:

#   mc "Oh, yes. I'm scheduled to meet Mr. [z]."
    mc "Ah, sí. He quedado con el Sr. [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5695
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_7e0dd09f:

#   "???" "He's running late but should be here any second."
    "???" "Lleva retraso, pero llegará en cualquier momento."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5700
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_e60b5f8d:

#   mct "[l] was spot on with [z]'s inner circle."
    mct "[l] dio en el clavo con el círculo íntimo de [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5701
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_dbd74f50:

#   mct "Those two circles look magnificent!"
    mct "¡Esos dos círculos tienen un aspecto magnífico!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5707
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_04369fdc:

#   "???" "I'll put it as diplomatically as I possibly can."
    "???" "Lo diré de la forma más diplomática posible."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5708
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_8f19e572:

#   "???" "Stop staring. It's creepy."
    "???" "Deja de mirar, es espeluznante."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5710
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_57892dda:

#   mc "Oh. Sorry."
    mc "Perdona."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5711
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_fb2b8c85:

#   mct "Busted!"
    mct "¡Pillado!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5721
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_35014704:

#   z "Ah, [mc]! There you are."
    z "Ah, [mc] Ahí estás."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5722
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_9790e849:

#   z "Pleasure to meet you in more civilized circumstances. What are you looking for today?"
    z "Un placer conocerte en circunstancias más civilizadas. ¿Qué buscas hoy?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5724
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_fb1cdaaf:

#   mc "A change in my life."
    mc "Un cambio en mi vida."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5725
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_519420a0:

#   z "Then you came to the right place! Don't spare the details!"
    z "¡Entonces has venido al lugar adecuado! ¡No escatimes en detalles!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5727
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_f4d52708:

#   mc "I'm like millions of others currently driving a regular, boring sedan. I have owned mine forever."
    mc "Soy como millones de personas que actualmente conducen una berlina normal y aburrida. Tengo la mía desde siempre."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5728
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_2c57e808:

#   mc "And while I drive it like I stole it, that's not it. I mean, what can you expect from a 30-year-old machine?"
    mc "Y aunque lo conduzco como si lo hubiera robado, no es eso. Es decir, ¿qué puedes esperar de una máquina de 30 años?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5730
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_931b9666:

#   z "While boring, those types of vehicles never fail. It is a safe option."
    z "Aunque aburridos, este tipo de vehículos nunca fallan. Es una opción segura."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5732
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_a74e138d:

#   mc "Safe isn't something I'm looking for."
    mc "La seguridad no es algo que busque."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5734
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_9543efac:

#   mc "New city, new life, and new me."
    mc "Nueva ciudad, nueva vida y nuevo yo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5736
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_c685e41b:

#   z "New? Leaving the old and boring for the daring and risky?"
    z "¿Nuevo? ¿Dejar lo viejo y aburrido por lo atrevido y arriesgado?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5737
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_f29bc50c:

#   mc "Exactly. I'm tired of people looking down on me just because of my low social status."
    mc "Exacto, estoy harta de que la gente me menosprecie sólo por mi bajo estatus social."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5739
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_372aefd0:

#   z "Ah. After becoming one of us... Excuse me, after purchasing one of our top-of-the-line vehicles, I can guarantee climbing the social ladder will not be an issue."
    z "Ah. Después de convertirte en uno de los nuestros... Perdón, después de comprar uno de nuestros vehículos de gama alta, puedo garantizarte que ascender en la escala social no será un problema."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5740
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_da3c4cf4:

#   z "What you need, Mr [mc], is a sports car. Let me tell you, it's not for everyone. Not everyone can handle the power."
    z "Lo que necesitas, Sr. [mc], es un coche deportivo. Déjame decirte que no es para todo el mundo. No todo el mundo puede manejar la potencia."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5742
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_e00bb181:

#   z "Dangerous, fast, demanding. It's not just a car. It's a lifestyle."
    z "Peligroso, rápido, exigente. No es sólo un coche, es un estilo de vida."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5744
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_b5a8f8cb:

#   mc "So it requires a full commitment? That's exactly what I'm here for."
    mc "¿Así que requiere un compromiso total? Eso es exactamente para lo que estoy aquí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5745
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_832da945:

#   z "Anything in particular you'd like?"
    z "¿Algo en particular que te gustaría?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5747
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_2b743d18:

#   mc "No offense, but there is nothing in the... standard offer that spikes my interest."
    mc "No te ofendas, pero no hay nada en la oferta... estándar que despierte mi interés."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5749
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_0cabc6c4:

#   z "That is precisely the answer I wanted to hear! How about we move the conversation to a more private space to discuss further details?"
    z "Ésa es precisamente la respuesta que quería oír! ¿Qué tal si trasladamos la conversación a un espacio más privado para discutir más detalles?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5750
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_0b13a794:

#   mc "Lead the way, Mr [z]."
    mc "Guíanos, Sr. [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5752
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_f3174480:

#   z "It's refreshing to have a customer like you. Anyone who enjoys regular cars for regular citizens, the blandness of it all, is simply wasting my time."
    z "Es refrescante tener un cliente como tú. Cualquiera que disfrute con coches normales para ciudadanos normales, con la insipidez de todo ello, simplemente está perdiendo el tiempo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5753
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_033070cb:

#   z "I employ people to handle these things for me, but you... You aim higher and I like that!"
    z "Yo empleo a gente para que se ocupe de estas cosas por mí, pero tú... ¡Tú apuntas más alto y eso me gusta!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5754
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_be9f20b8:

#   mc "You only live once, am I right?"
    mc "Sólo se vive una vez, ¿tengo razón?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5756
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_37f46bcd:

#   z "Ah! I've got exactly what you're looking for."
    z "Tengo exactamente lo que buscas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5757
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_e088870a:

#   z "A special place. Rarest cars."
    z "Un lugar especial. Coches rarísimos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5762
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_60f9b90e:

#   z "The best opportunities for genuine character development."
    z "Las mejores oportunidades para un auténtico desarrollo del carácter."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5770
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_bfaa5303:

#   mc "Damn! Now we're talking!"
    mc "¡Maldita sea! ¡Ahora sí!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5775
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_04279878:

#   z "Everything you see is 100%% legal. Even if it isn't legal, no law enforcement poses any threat under my protection."
    z "Todo lo que ves es 100%% legal. Aunque no lo sea, ninguna aplicación de la ley supone amenaza alguna bajo mi protección."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5777
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9231419f:

#   mc "It sounds too good to be true. Where are the hooks?"
    mc "Suena demasiado bueno para ser verdad. ¿Dónde están los anzuelos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5778
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ed9ef334:

#   z "Hooks? None. Requirements, more likely."
    z "¿Ganchos? Ninguno. Requisitos, más probablemente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5780
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_904ad28a:

#   z "You need more than two brain cells to operate in a heavy-stress environment."
    z "Necesitas más de dos neuronas para funcionar en un entorno de mucho estrés."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5781
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_86c31637:

#   mc "Understandably so."
    mc "Es comprensible."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5783
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_eb1da9a1:

#   z "One wrong move and you end up on the wrong side of the road."
    z "Un paso en falso y acabarás en el lado equivocado de la carretera."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5784
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_808821df:

#   mc "Or doing a 180 spin and seeing yourself going against the flow."
    mc "O dar un giro de 180º y verte a ti mismo yendo contra corriente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5786
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_6df81655:

#   z "Exactly. Adequate capabilities! A skill to recognize the necessary course of action in an instant."
    z "Exacto. ¡Capacidades adecuadas! Una habilidad para reconocer el curso de acción necesario en un instante."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5792
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_89d94648:

#   mc "Damn, that's impressive!"
    mc "Joder, ¡es impresionante!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5793
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9bd8fc6a:

#   mc "Hmm. I've dealt with dangerous matters before. I've got the required experience."
    mc "Ya me he ocupado de asuntos peligrosos, tengo la experiencia necesaria."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5797
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_1216acc3:

#   mc "And making split-second decisions falls under my specialty."
    mc "Y tomar decisiones en fracciones de segundo entra dentro de mi especialidad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5799
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ee8b9e5c:

#   mc "Rule no.1: don't try to pull out your gun when someone's already aiming at you."
    mc "Regla nº 1: no intentes sacar el arma cuando alguien ya te esté apuntando."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5800
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_5c194efe:

#   mc "And you're not fast enough."
    mc "Y no eres lo suficientemente rápido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5802
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_aa0071b7:

#   z "I see you prefer a more direct approach. You work for me now and that comes with specific responsibilities."
    z "Veo que prefieres un enfoque más directo. Ahora trabajas para mí y eso conlleva responsabilidades específicas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5803
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_d588c35c:

#   z "Word travels fast around this city and it won't be long before everyone knows who you are."
    z "En esta ciudad se corre la voz rápidamente y no tardará mucho en que todo el mundo sepa quién eres."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5805
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_19ce4988:

#   z "Untouchable, respected, feared. There is a lot to process for someone new to the city and new to the business. Try not to drown yourself in glory."
    z "Intocable, respetado, temido. Hay mucho que procesar para alguien nuevo en la ciudad y nuevo en el negocio. Intenta no ahogarte en la gloria."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5807
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c984fb91:

#   mc "I know how to handle the pressure and fame that comes with being a member of your crew."
    mc "Sé cómo manejar la presión y la fama que conlleva ser miembro de tu equipo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5809
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_5df737cb:

#   z "You're not a god. Don't act like one. Not until you have a reputation that proves it."
    z "No eres un dios. No actúes como tal. No hasta que tengas una reputación que lo demuestre."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5810
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_52f069d9:

#   z "Loyalty, a trait forgotten and disregarded amongst the younger generation, is still cherished in my circle."
    z "La lealtad, un rasgo olvidado y despreciado entre la generación más joven, sigue siendo apreciado en mi círculo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5811
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9f294e22:

#   z "We're family now."
    z "Ahora somos familia."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5815
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_3dd5bd50:

#   mc "It's an honor, Mr.[z]."
    mc "Es un honor, Sr. [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5818
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_bd3dbf3f:

#   mc "I saw a famous movie once upon a time where the 'family' word was thrown around at every corner."
    mc "Hace tiempo vi una famosa película en la que la palabra \"familia\" aparecía en cada esquina."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5819
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_23149186:

#   mc "I think I get what you mean."
    mc "Creo que entiendo lo que quieres decir."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5821
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ba2e47eb:

#   z "We take things seriously here. Prove your physical aptitude and your creativity on special occasions..."
    z "Aquí nos tomamos las cosas en serio. Demuestra tu aptitud física y tu creatividad en ocasiones especiales..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5822
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_49cb7482:

#   z "... and what I require from you on a day to day basis is chauffeuring."
    z "... y lo que requiero de ti en el día a día es chófer."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5824
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_5666c80c:

#   mc "Let's say I earned my driver's license without even needing to take a test."
    mc "Digamos que me he sacado el carné de conducir sin ni siquiera tener que hacer un examen."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5825
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c6954a5f:

#   z "Good."
    z "Bien."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5827
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ba4fd523:

#   mc "What do I do daily?"
    mc "¿Qué hago a diario?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5829
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_d8ed918f:

#   z "You're under my command. A personal driver for me, my wife, and my daughter."
    z "Estás a mis órdenes. Un chófer personal para mí, mi mujer y mi hija."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5830
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_79d6c856:

#   z "We need you, you show up in an instant and drive. Defend if necessary. No additional questions."
    z "Te necesitamos, apareces en un instante y conduces. Defiendes si es necesario. No hay preguntas adicionales."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5832
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_78a6ebe8:

#   z "Any whims from my daughter or wife, you're at their full disposal. Is that clear?"
    z "Cualquier capricho de mi hija o de mi mujer, estás a su entera disposición, ¿está claro?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5833
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_1bf60051:

#   mc "Of course."
    mc "Por supuesto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5838
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_07715cd7:

#   z "Additionally, when no immediate orders are available, show up at my bar. Raise the Glass."
    z "Además, cuando no haya pedidos inmediatos, preséntate en mi bar y levanta la copa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5839
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c7863d88:

#   z "I believe you know where it is. There is always something to do there."
    z "Creo que sabes dónde está. Siempre hay algo que hacer allí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5840
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_2051d66a:

#   mc "Understood."
    mc "Entendido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5842
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c6fe96b4:

#   z "Do what you are told. Be good at your job and I see our cooperation going a long way."
    z "Haz lo que te digan. Sé bueno en tu trabajo y veo que nuestra cooperación llegará muy lejos."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5843
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_d63202ea:

#   z "Welcome to the Zhine family, boy."
    z "Bienvenido a la familia Zhine, muchacho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5845
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_89110ec4:

#   mc "Thank you, sir."
    mc "Gracias, señor."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5848
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_21958ef7:

#   z "Ah. [cl]."
    z "Ah. [cl]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5849
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_254b1144:

#   cl "Sir, you've got an off site meeting scheduled in half an hour. We've got to get moving."
    cl "Señor, tiene una reunión fuera de la sede programada para dentro de media hora. Tenemos que ponernos en marcha."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5850
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ca0e5f4e:

#   z "Which one?"
    z "¿Cuál?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5852
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9c5e506f:

#   cl "Ummm..."
    cl "Ummm..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5853
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_ee4894ac:

#   z "Don't worry about [mc]. He just became a part of the family."
    z "No te preocupes por [mc]. Acaba de entrar a formar parte de la familia."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5855
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c8f65052:

#   cl "The meeting set up to clear some... inconsistencies between... families."
    cl "La reunión se organizó para aclarar algunas... incoherencias entre... familias."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5856
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_1c735a05:

#   cl "And... the usual transportation matter. We need more men."
    cl "Y... el asunto habitual del transporte. Necesitamos más hombres."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5858
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_47408cd0:

#   z "Ah. I almost forgot."
    z "Ah, casi se me olvida."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5859
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_0d1501aa:

#   z "You. First task. Get [k] and bring her back to the mansion."
    z "Tú. Primera tarea. Coge a [k] y llévala de vuelta a la mansión."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5860
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_fb86e543:

#   z "She finishes class in 5 minutes. Don't make her wait."
    z "Termina la clase en 5 minutos, no la hagas esperar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5862
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_fd446674:

#   cl "Ready, Mr [z]?"
    cl "¿Listo, Sr. [z]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5863
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_af1d0a4d:

#   z "Let's move."
    z "En marcha."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5865
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_0534eac8:

#   z "Take my car. I don't want [k] seen in a 50-year-old scrapyard junk."
    z "Llévate mi coche. No quiero que [k] se vea en un desguace de chatarra de 50 años."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5866
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9267d4f4:

#   mc "Of course, Mr [z]!"
    mc "¡Por supuesto, Sr. [z]!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5868
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_9e2edb49:

#   mct "Damn..."
    mct "Maldita sea..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5871
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_7bd71b08:

#   mct "Pick up [k]! From where? How do I find her without even knowing what she looks like?"
    mct "¡Recoge a [k]! ¿De dónde? ¿Cómo la encuentro sin saber siquiera cómo es?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5872
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_d4e5dcb7:

#   mct "More than two brain cells. Bla. Bla. Bla. More like being clairvoyant."
    mct "Más bien ser clarividente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5876
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_showroom_c92b817b:

#   mct "I'd better contact [v] to help me out."
    mct "Será mejor que me ponga en contacto con [v] para que me ayude."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5883
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_f0027230:

#   l "*whistling*"
    l "* silbidos *"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5890
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_983229c3:

#   l "Wait a second... It's you, isn't it?"
    l "Espera un momento... Eres tú, ¿verdad?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5892
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_65c77a70:

#   l "My beauty! I knew you would show up again!"
    l "¡Belleza mía! ¡Sabía que volverías a aparecer!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5896
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_6fc2de84:

#   l "And ready for the taking!"
    l "¡Y listo para tomar!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5898
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_1db3f6bf:

#   l "You are mine now!"
    l "¡Ahora eres mía!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5903
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_eea96bec:

#   v "Tell me what you need to know."
    v "Dime lo que necesitas saber."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5904
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_f1f93556:

#   mc "Pick up [k], who I assume is his daughter."
    mc "Recoge a [k], que supongo que es su hija."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5906
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_7ebd6dde:

#   mc "From where? School? Uni? I need some help here!"
    mc "¿De dónde? ¿De la escuela? ¿De la universidad? ¡Necesito ayuda!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5907
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_6b580bf6:

#   v "That's what I'm here for."
    v "Para eso estoy aquí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5909
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_df53290d:

#   v "Not from school."
    v "No de la escuela."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5910
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_e13c9756:

#   v "Uni. The University of Zhine. [k] [z]. Age 19."
    v "Uni. La Universidad de Zhine. [k] [z] Edad 19."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5912
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_90e73d08:

#   mc "Jesus, anything NOT [z] related in this city? New Zhine City, Zhine this, Zhine that... It's everywhere!"
    mc "Jesús, ¿hay algo que NO esté relacionado con [z] en esta ciudad? Nueva Ciudad Zhine, Zhine esto, Zhine lo otro... ¡Está por todas partes!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5913
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_9b194fb3:

#   v "Seems like he owns the place."
    v "Parece que es el dueño del lugar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5915
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_4f4882a2:

#   mc "Any pictures of what [k] looks like?"
    mc "¿Alguna foto de cómo es [k]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5916
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_fc718c0b:

#   v "Sure, you're gonna love her."
    v "Claro, te va a encantar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5918
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_83566ceb:

#   mc "Happy to hear that, but I need some way to recognize her."
    mc "Me alegra oírlo, pero necesito alguna forma de reconocerla."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5919
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_44847d19:

#   v "Sending."
    v "Envío."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5921
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_d06ee8f9:

#   v "Done."
    v "Hecho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5922
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_4f91d18b:

#   mc "I'm still looking for a needle in a haystack."
    mc "Sigo buscando una aguja en un pajar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5923
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_c5e592ea:

#   mc "Five minutes to drive to the uni and find the girl."
    mc "Cinco minutos para ir a la uni y encontrar a la chica."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5925
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_610dad93:

#   v "Good luck!"
    v "Buena suerte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5927
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_d5f4526b:

#   mc "I'm gonna be so fucking late!"
    mc "¡Voy a llegar jodidamente tarde!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5928
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_04921b47:

#   v "Make sure to find a good excuse without blaming her father, of course."
    v "Asegúrate de encontrar una buena excusa sin culpar a su padre, por supuesto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5940
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_e6126b55:

#   mc "Damn it!"
    mc "¡Maldita sea!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5945
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_8d67f4a5:

#   n "Oh-oh."
    n "Oh-oh."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5946
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_ef26bf44:

#   n "What if [k] is like her father? Bossy and impatient."
    n "¿Y si [k] es como su padre? Mandona e impaciente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5948
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_5ce26f6e:

#   n "I mean, she was born into royalty. Little [k] smells like a spoiled brat from a mile away!"
    n "Es decir, nació en la realeza. ¡La pequeña [k] huele a mocosa consentida a la legua!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5949
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_a5031450:

#   n "And you, late? Those types of people don't wait. You WAIT for them and not the other way around."
    n "¿Y tú, tarde? Ese tipo de gente no espera. Tú ESPERA por ellos y no al revés."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5951
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_93c23b63:

#   mc "Where's [v]?"
    mc "¿Dónde está [v]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5953
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_adc4706c:

#   n "She took a break. You're stuck with me."
    n "Te has quedado conmigo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5956
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_af29067c:

#   n "Don't you like my voice?"
    n "¿No te gusta mi voz?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5959
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_549c09e3:

#   n "Hmmm?"
    n "¿Hmmm?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5964
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_720a99b0:

#   mc "I like the voice. Just not the words coming out of your mouth."
    mc "Me gusta la voz, pero no las palabras que salen de tu boca."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5965
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_3e7505ab:

#   n "Oh."
    n "Oh."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5968
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_a0fe8125:

#   mc "Not sure if it's motion sickness or your voice. I don't feel too good."
    mc "No estoy seguro de si es el mareo o tu voz. No me siento muy bien."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5969
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_3a4250ea:

#   n "Ew!"
    n "¡Ew!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5972
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_3ed2f2e1:

#   n "Either way, get used to it. You'll hear it a lot."
    n "En cualquier caso, acostúmbrate, lo oirás mucho."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5973
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_e3bccd93:

#   mc "Just curious, weren't you born into royalty? You know, the spoiled brat seems to fit."
    mc "Sólo por curiosidad, ¿no naciste en la realeza? Lo de niña mimada parece encajar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5975
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_7997b1c0:

#   n "Haha! Nope. I'm not."
    n "Jaja, no."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5976
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_b99f8da9:

#   n "You're getting close."
    n "Te estás acercando."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5978
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_4350ce44:

#   mc "With guessing your heritage?"
    mc "¿Con adivinar tu herencia?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5979
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_6344036b:

#   n "No, to the target, dumbass!"
    n "No, al objetivo, ¡imbécil!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5980
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_7a5f0aba:

#   n "Good luck explaining yourself!"
    n "¡Buena suerte explicándote!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5982
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_2205ec12:

#   n "What the..."
    n "Lo que..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5983
translate HZIlle ep1_zag_after_a6a2dead:

#   n "Talk to you later, [mc]!"
    n "¡Hablamos luego, [mc]!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5991
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_0d6dba32:

#   l "Look who found me!"
    l "¡Mira quién me ha encontrado!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5992
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_4d886949:

#   n "Found?"
    n "¿Encontrado?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5994
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_ab8a1a79:

#   l "It's destiny! It has to be!"
    l "¡Es el destino! ¡Tiene que serlo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5995
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_cea6ac47:

#   l "She was just sitting at the gas station, open, just waiting to be taken!"
    l "Estaba sentada en la gasolinera, abierta, ¡esperando a que la cogieran!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5997
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_65b16f8f:

#   n "There is no such thing as destiny in the sim."
    n "El destino no existe en la simulación."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:5998
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_3b3d4beb:

#   n "Is it wired? Bugged?"
    n "¿Tiene micrófonos?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6000
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_46c2520f:

#   l "Only one way to find out!"
    l "¡Sólo hay una forma de averiguarlo!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6001
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_6bae414c:

#   l "Isn't it beautiful to finally have a purpose in life? Rebuild a 40-year-old car?"
    l "¿No es hermoso tener por fin un propósito en la vida? ¿Reconstruir un coche de 40 años?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6003
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_1e44cec0:

#   n "It does feel kind of nice!"
    n "La sensación es muy agradable."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6004
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_89b41229:

#   l "Glad I could be of help."
    l "Me alegro de haberte ayudado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6007
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_2a5b0698:

#   l "Come, legless redhead, we have work to do!"
    l "Ven, pelirroja sin piernas, ¡tenemos trabajo que hacer!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6008
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_9d4c9886:

#   n "Why do I feel like it's one of your dumb movie quotes?"
    n "¿Por qué me parece que es una de tus citas tontas de películas?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6010
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_ada2ba79:

#   l "The legless redhead was an original idea!"
    l "¡La pelirroja sin piernas fue una idea original!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6011
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_da6dcebd:

#   l "We have work to do! Well, someone at some point in time might have said that in a certain fantasy world..."
    l "Tenemos trabajo que hacer! Bueno, alguien en algún momento pudo haber dicho eso en cierto mundo de fantasía..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6013
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_c27b0fcd:

#   l "... to an orc."
    l "... a un orco."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6014
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_2aa1ff16:

#   n "That analogy reaches so far that you barely kept up telling it. How the fuck was I supposed to understand it?"
    n "Esa analogía llega tan lejos que apenas has podido contarla. ¿Cómo coño iba a entenderla?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6016
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_45020991:

#   l "Meh, who cares. Where's [mc]?"
    l "A quién le importa. ¿Dónde está [mc]?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6022
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_4db5d2a8:

#   n "Traveling around the world trying to find [z]'s daughter."
    n "Viajando por el mundo intentando encontrar a la hija de [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6023
translate HZIlle ep1_warehouse_car_c15cf305:

#   n "At this point, he may actually discover a new continent."
    n "Llegados a este punto, puede que descubra un nuevo continente."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6032
translate HZIlle ep1_university_47a3fb68:

