    mc "¿Cómo era el conductor anterior?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6256
translate HZIlle ep1_university_28a4b5ed:

#   k "Hmm. I didn't like him. At least now, my father found someone capable of speaking."
    k "No me gustaba. Al menos ahora, mi padre ha encontrado a alguien capaz de hablar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6258
translate HZIlle ep1_university_1a4b3e3d:

#   mc "My predecessor wasn't too talkative, huh?"
    mc "Mi predecesor no era muy hablador, ¿eh?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6259
translate HZIlle ep1_university_e58e4100:

#   k "Soldier type. Always silent. He treated bringing me home like a life and death mission. I felt weird."
    k "Tipo soldado. Siempre callado. Trataba el traerme a casa como una misión de vida o muerte. Me sentía rara."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6261
translate HZIlle ep1_university_357705fd:

#   k "He used to drive up to the very doors waiting for me."
    k "Solía conducir hasta las mismas puertas esperándome."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6262
translate HZIlle ep1_university_302fabd7:

#   mc "Woah. Isn't that a bit too much?"
    mc "Vaya, ¿no es demasiado?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6264
translate HZIlle ep1_university_c6883dbb:

#   k "I told him I hated it, but he didn't care."
    k "Le dije que lo odiaba, pero no le importó."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6265
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d5fb537c:

#   mc "At least your colleagues think you're badass with a personal driver."
    mc "Al menos tus colegas piensan que eres un malote con chófer personal."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6267
translate HZIlle ep1_university_91de72d6:

#   k "Mhm."
    k "Mhm."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6268
translate HZIlle ep1_university_1b7cd305:

#   mc "Anyway, things have progressed! You wouldn't believe it, but nowadays we have parking lots!"
    mc "En fin, ¡las cosas han progresado! No te lo creerías, pero hoy en día ¡tenemos aparcamientos!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6269
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d5dd4c76:

#   mc "Isn't that nice?"
    mc "¿No es bonito?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6271
translate HZIlle ep1_university_4a1826a4:

#   k "Yes, it is."
    k "Sí, lo es."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6278
translate HZIlle ep1_university_b7be2fa3:

#   mc "I'm so sorry for being late. It won't happen again."
    mc "Siento mucho haber llegado tarde, no volverá a ocurrir."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6279
translate HZIlle ep1_university_da61ea8c:

#   k "What happened?"
    k "¿Qué ha ocurrido?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6281
translate HZIlle ep1_university_c49c5cfd:

#   mc "A mixture of everything. Not knowing you, not knowing what you do, where you are. Plus the traffic!"
    mc "Una mezcla de todo. No conocerte, no saber lo que haces, dónde estás... ¡Además del tráfico!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6282
translate HZIlle ep1_university_610a69df:

#   k "Abandon the traffic factor. My mom won't like it."
    k "Abandona el factor tráfico, a mi madre no le gustará."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6284
translate HZIlle ep1_university_ec7b437c:

#   mc "Everything against me!"
    mc "¡Todo contra mí!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6285
translate HZIlle ep1_university_ac525462:

#   k "You should not worry about it."
    k "No debes preocuparte por ello."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6287
translate HZIlle ep1_university_a3bf1a96:

#   mc "Thanks, [k]!"
    mc "¡Gracias, [k]!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6289
translate HZIlle ep1_university_a2975a87:

#   k "But you have to get used to it. If you work for my father cutting corners, unfinished sentences are on a daily basis."
    k "Pero tienes que acostumbrarte. Si trabajas para mi padre, los recortes y las frases inacabadas son el pan de cada día."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6290
translate HZIlle ep1_university_0aae85b5:

#   mc "Reading his mind is the only option, then?"
    mc "¿Leer su mente es la única opción, entonces?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6292
translate HZIlle ep1_university_506f47fe:

#   k "That's one way to put it."
    k "Es una forma de decirlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6299
translate HZIlle ep1_university_3d5f64cb:

#   mc "Let's keep moving. I still have the life-threatening mission of taking you home."
    mc "Sigamos adelante. Aún tengo la misión vital de llevarte a casa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6305
translate HZIlle ep1_university_69758e27:

#   k "Finally, sitting in the front seat. It feels nice."
    k "Por fin, sentado en el asiento delantero, se está bien."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6306
translate HZIlle ep1_university_90828f82:

#   mc "You weren't allowed?"
    mc "¿No te lo permitieron?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6308
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d8846ebf:

#   k "Mhm. Only in the backseat. Like a VIP."
    k "Sólo en el asiento trasero, como un VIP."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6309
translate HZIlle ep1_university_0bcc1e3e:

#   mc "You don't have to be a VIP to sit in the back, Ms [k]. Non-VIPs would know how taxis work!"
    mc "No hace falta ser VIP para sentarse atrás, Sra. [k] ¡Los no VIP sabrían cómo funcionan los taxis!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6311
translate HZIlle ep1_university_90254c6f:

#   k "Ouch!"
    k "¡Ay!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6312
translate HZIlle ep1_university_5b3523bc:

#   mc "I'm sorry, it was only a joke."
    mc "Lo siento, sólo era una broma."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6313
translate HZIlle ep1_university_95b491a0:

#   mc "Navigate me. Where do I turn next?"
    mc "Navegadme. ¿Adónde me dirijo ahora?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6315
translate HZIlle ep1_university_4c05e511:

#   k "Right here."
    k "Aquí mismo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6316
translate HZIlle ep1_university_8cb25b60:

#   k "So... Who are you?"
    k "Entonces... ¿Quién eres?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6318
translate HZIlle ep1_university_221e1543:

#   mc "The new driver."
    mc "El nuevo conductor."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6319
translate HZIlle ep1_university_6c24aa09:

#   k "I need more. Remind me of your name again?"
    k "Necesito más. ¿Recuérdame otra vez tu nombre?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6320
translate HZIlle ep1_university_bd7d9df9:

#   mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6322
translate HZIlle ep1_university_78398bee:

#   k "[mc] the driver. You don't strike me as someone who does this for a living."
    k "[mc] el conductor. No me pareces alguien que se gane la vida con esto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6323
translate HZIlle ep1_university_cb0b0620:

#   mc "Does it show?"
    mc "¿Se nota?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6325
translate HZIlle ep1_university_fe29934e:

#   k "Mhmmm."
    k "Mhmmm."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6326
translate HZIlle ep1_university_7f8844ce:

#   mc "In a good way, I hope?"
    mc "Espero que en el buen sentido."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6328
translate HZIlle ep1_university_64ac4548:

#   k "Yes."
    k "Sí."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6329
translate HZIlle ep1_university_c6bce440:

#   mc "I'm ex-military."
    mc "Soy ex-militar."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6330
translate HZIlle ep1_university_01b8c500:

#   mc "Does that work for you?"
    mc "¿Te parece bien?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6332
translate HZIlle ep1_university_48d07fb6:

#   k "I don't mind. At least you talk."
    k "No me importa, al menos hablas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6333
translate HZIlle ep1_university_47a9909c:

#   k "The previous one never talked to me. It's like they were explicitly instructed not to. You're the opposite."
    k "El anterior nunca me habló. Es como si les hubieran ordenado explícitamente que no lo hicieran. Tú eres todo lo contrario."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6335
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d0bfa929:

#   mc "Not talking to you wasn't in my job description. I'm not breaking any rules. Yet."
    mc "No hablar contigo no estaba en la descripción de mi trabajo. No estoy incumpliendo ninguna norma. Todavía."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6336
translate HZIlle ep1_university_6782343d:

#   k "Now I don't feel so alienated."
    k "Ahora no me siento tan alienado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6337
translate HZIlle ep1_university_fd0c436d:

#   mc "Good thing I'm here to help you settle back on Earth, Ms Alien."
    mc "Menos mal que estoy aquí para ayudarte a instalarte de nuevo en la Tierra, Sra. Extraterrestre."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6339
translate HZIlle ep1_university_ce7e1366:

#   k "It's quite fascinating."
    k "Es fascinante."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6340
translate HZIlle ep1_university_40dd3be3:

#   mc "Oh-oh. Don't tell me you're studying psychology."
    mc "No me digas que estudias psicología."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6342
translate HZIlle ep1_university_053ecd57:

#   k "Yes, I do."
    k "Sí, es cierto."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6343
translate HZIlle ep1_university_8e28d956:

#   mc "Oh no..."
    mc "Oh, no..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6347
translate HZIlle ep1_university_5488c39f:

#   mc "Ms Kendra, I'm going to stop right there and ask you to switch to the backseat. Thank you!"
    mc "Sra. Kendra, voy a detenerme ahí mismo y pedirle que se pase al asiento de atrás ¡Gracias!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6348
translate HZIlle ep1_university_af9dfd49:

#   k "Oh. You don't really mean that."
    k "No lo dices en serio."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6351
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d21aee7e:

#   k "You don't like being analyzed?"
    k "¿No te gusta que te analicen?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6352
translate HZIlle ep1_university_279a3f91:

#   mc "Not one bit. I don't think you're going to like what you'll find inside."
    mc "Ni una pizca. No creo que te guste lo que encontrarás dentro."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6354
translate HZIlle ep1_university_c4f04aca:

#   k "I won't judge."
    k "No te juzgaré."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6356
translate HZIlle ep1_university_3d847e17:

#   k "I won't be annoying, I promise. At least I'll try."
    k "No seré pesada, lo prometo, al menos lo intentaré."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6357
translate HZIlle ep1_university_6ba6d4d8:

#   k "Although, your reluctance to engage in a meaningful conversation would imply that you've got something to hide. I don't like that."
    k "Aunque tu reticencia a entablar una conversación significativa implicaría que tienes algo que ocultar, y eso no me gusta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6359
translate HZIlle ep1_university_ff6cdffe:

#   mc "Oh, look! Flock of birds!"
    mc "¡Oh, mira! ¡Una bandada de pájaros!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6363
translate HZIlle ep1_university_b1acbb31:

#   k "Are you my regular driver now or is it just a one-time thing?"
    k "¿Ahora eres mi conductor habitual o es algo puntual?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6368
translate HZIlle ep1_university_fae117d3:

#   mc "According to Mr [z], he and his whole family, whoever that includes, are my priority."
    mc "Según el Sr. [z], él y toda su familia, sea quien sea, son mi prioridad."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6369
translate HZIlle ep1_university_d75160b5:

#   k "I'm happy to know that. We'll have therapeutic sessions on each way home."
    k "Me alegra saberlo. Tendremos sesiones terapéuticas de camino a casa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6374
translate HZIlle ep1_university_aa7468b2:

#   mc "Uh-oh."
    mc "Oh-oh."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6375
translate HZIlle ep1_university_a415909a:

#   k "It was only a joke."
    k "Sólo era una broma."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6380
translate HZIlle ep1_university_0669cda4:

#   k "Take me back to the mansion, please. I'm sure we've got some explaining to do."
    k "Llévame a la mansión, por favor. Seguro que tenemos que dar algunas explicaciones."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6386
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_d9d300ad:

#   mc "Damn..."
    mc "Maldita sea..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6387
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_c0074b7f:

#   k "Don't tell me you've never seen it before."
    k "No me digas que no lo has visto nunca."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6392
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_11ca4cce:

#   mc "I haven't. You really meant it when you said mansion."
    mc "No lo he hecho. Lo decías en serio cuando dijiste mansión."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6393
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_1ab7e04f:

#   k "Annoying as it is, everyone knows about Fort Zhine."
    k "Por muy molesto que sea, todo el mundo conoce el Fuerte Zhine."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6395
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_063fe27b:

#   mc "Someone's really obsessed with that name."
    mc "Alguien está realmente obsesionado con ese nombre."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6396
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_0ba2d2fe:

#   k "That's true. Follow me."
    k "Es verdad, sígueme."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6398
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_e1b21201:

#   mc "Is there anything not owned or related to your family?"
    mc "¿Hay algo que no pertenezca o esté relacionado con tu familia?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6400
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_2edb2e92:

#   k "Yes. A strip club. Night Beats."
    k "Sí. Un club de striptease. Night Beats."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6401
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_6330a027:

#   k "18+ activities ruin the image."
    k "Las actividades para mayores de 18 años arruinan la imagen."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6403
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_085069f5:

#   mc "Yeah, everything porn related ruins your life."
    mc "Sí, todo lo relacionado con el porno te arruina la vida."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6404
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_f2a36351:

#   mc "PR, I mean."
    mc "Me refiero a las relaciones públicas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6406
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_c63c321e:

#   k "That's an interesting take. Would you like to elaborate?"
    k "Es una opinión interesante, ¿quieres explicarla?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6407
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_0014a679:

#   mc "I'd rather not."
    mc "Prefiero no hacerlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6412
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_ca7c7bf2:

#   k "So you've also never seen Mrs [z]."
    k "Así que tampoco has visto nunca a la Sra. [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6413
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_df25ce0d:

#   mc "No. Should I be scared?"
    mc "No. ¿Debería tener miedo?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6415
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_4330a76c:

#   k "Not if you're on her good side. Mom never tolerates bullshit."
    k "No si estás de su parte. Mamá nunca tolera las tonterías."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6416
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_523d33ed:

#   k "Sorry. Poor excuses."
    k "Lo siento, pobres excusas."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6418
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_6243b03c:

#   mc "Noted. Sounds scary, though."
    mc "Tomo nota, aunque suena aterrador."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6419
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_889c3b96:

#   k "She can be."
    k "Puede serlo."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6421
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_653f6e63:

#   k "That's [em]. She helps us around the house."
    k "Es [em]. Nos ayuda en casa."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6422
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_3f3a69c7:

#   mc "Hello [em]."
    mc "Hola [em]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6424
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_4ac6ec95:

#   em "What a handsome gentleman! [k], you didn't tell me you've got a boyfriend! Finally!"
    em "¡Qué caballero más guapo! [k], ¡no me habías dicho que tenías novio! ¡Por fin!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6425
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_f5331c78:

#   em "I'm so happy for you!"
    em "¡Me alegro mucho por ti!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6427
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_d1d4e526:

#   k "Please stop. I... I don't have a boyfriend! You know that!"
    k "Por favor, para. Yo... ¡No tengo novio! ¡Lo sabes!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6428
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_36583da0:

#   mc "I'm the new chauffeur Mr [z] hired."
    mc "Soy el nuevo chófer que ha contratado el Sr. [z]."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6430
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_f9ddc0da:

#   em "Oh. Nice to meet you."
    em "Encantada de conocerte."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6431
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_adf9b3e8:

#   em "If there is anything you need, please let me know."
    em "Si necesitas algo, házmelo saber."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6433
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_a64e8bc0:

#   mc "Thanks."
    mc "Gracias."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6441
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_cdb22a6a:

#   mct "Sweet mother of..."
    mct "Dulce madre de..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6442
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_6e619c5a:

#   k "Let me do the talking, please. Unless you want a lecture too."
    k "Déjame hablar a mí, por favor. A menos que tú también quieras un sermón."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6447
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_940b3d1e:

#   k "Hi, Mom!"
    k "¡Hola, mamá!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6449
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_907b87ce:

#   lil "[k], sweetheart, any reasons for being late?"
    lil "[k], cariño, ¿algún motivo para llegar tarde?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6450
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_0d32349e:

#   k "I know, mom! I know! Umm... Unexpected state of affairs."
    k "Lo sé, mamá! ¡Lo sé! Umm... Un estado de cosas inesperado."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6452
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_a189589c:

#   lil "And you are?"
    lil "¿Y tú eres?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6453
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_1b03ec0e:

#   mc "[mc], the new driver."
    mc "[mc], el nuevo conductor."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6455
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_77b77a25:

#   lil "You're the reason my daughter is home late?"
    lil "¿Tú eres la razón de que mi hija llegue tarde a casa?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6457
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_2c9d3cad:

#   k "It's..."
    k "Es..."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6465
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_d2450f9f:

#   mc "It's completely my fault, Mrs [z]. There are no excuses for my mistake."
    mc "Es completamente culpa mía, Sra. [z] No hay excusas para mi error."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6466
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_d82a62eb:

#   lil "I still need an explanation."
    lil "Sigo necesitando una explicación."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6468
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_3bd239d0:

#   mc "It's my first day. I was told I had to be at the University a few minutes before her classes finished."
    mc "Es mi primer día. Me dijeron que tenía que estar en la Universidad unos minutos antes de que terminaran sus clases."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6469
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_fd361fe8:

#   mc "During rush hour."
    mc "En hora punta."

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6471
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_943e899e:

#   lil "Are you blaming Hector?"
    lil "¿Estás culpando a Héctor?"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6472
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_a0468a46:

#   k "Mom! Stop!"
    k "¡Mamá! ¡Para!"

# game/episodes/episode1.rpy:6474
translate HZIlle ep1_mansion_58f1ea13:

#   mc "No, Mrs [z]. Just providing a truthful statement without putting the blame on anyone but myself."
    mc "No, Sra. [z]. Sólo proporcionaba una declaración veraz sin echar la culpa a nadie más que a mí misma."

